The wire types of the yuzu/openai package are derived from the OpenAI Go SDK
(https://github.com/openai/openai-go), which is licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. Their field names and JSON encodings are kept identical
so that requests and responses stay compatible with the OpenAI API.

